WEBVTT

00:01.460 --> 00:02.580
<b>I mean...</b>

00:02.920 --> 00:06.380
<b>I do the voice acting for
05th Floor Alliance's game,</b>

00:07.420 --> 00:11.580
<b>but you let me be part of the group
without telling anyone about it.</b>

00:12.250 --> 00:19.170
<b>If you hadn't reached out to me that day
just because you knew my brother,</b>

00:19.250 --> 00:22.790
<b>I probably wouldn't be here right now.</b>

00:49.670 --> 00:55.330
<b>MY FRIEND'S LITTLE SISTER HAS IT IN FOR ME!</b>

01:55.880 --> 01:58.580
<b><i>Ozu and I became friends in middle school.</i></b>

01:59.210 --> 02:01.420
<b><i>He was known as an oddball back then.</i></b>

02:01.960 --> 02:04.210
<b><i>The science room was his</i>
<i>one and only place of refuge,</i></b>

02:04.290 --> 02:07.960
<b><i>but rumors spread that he was performing</i>
<i>dangerous experiments in there,</i></b>

02:08.040 --> 02:09.670
<b><i>so he was left with nowhere to go.</i></b>

02:10.500 --> 02:11.540
<b>Hey.</b>

02:12.420 --> 02:14.880
<b>Can't you do your experiments at home?</b>

02:15.290 --> 02:17.170
<b>My place isn't really...</b>

02:19.750 --> 02:24.380
<b>If I invent something at my house,
will you come over to see it?</b>

02:24.460 --> 02:28.170
<b>Sure, if that's all it takes to keep you
doing what you're doing.</b>

02:28.460 --> 02:31.330
<b>It'd be a real shame to let
your talents go to waste.</b>

02:31.630 --> 02:36.000
<b>Yeah? In that case,
I guess I could do them at home.</b>

02:36.290 --> 02:39.420
<b><i>That was when I decided</i>
<i>to protect Ozu's talents—</i></b>

02:39.500 --> 02:40.920
<b><i>and how we became best friends.</i></b>

02:41.540 --> 02:45.330
<b><i>After that, when my parents</i>
<i>went abroad for work,</i></b>

02:45.420 --> 02:47.960
<b><i>I decided to stay here.</i></b>

02:54.580 --> 02:56.630
<b>What're you doing?</b>

02:57.960 --> 03:00.170
<b>Oh, Aki. Hey.</b>

03:00.250 --> 03:02.960
<b>I was using the size of the
floor tiles in the lobby</b>

03:03.080 --> 03:06.210
<b>to work out how many tiles
are used in the entire building</b>

03:06.290 --> 03:08.630
<b>and how much they cost.</b>

03:08.960 --> 03:12.420
<b>Just playing with numbers
in my head. That's all.</b>

03:12.500 --> 03:14.790
<b>O-Oh... I see.</b>

03:14.880 --> 03:17.460
<b>How'd you end up deciding to do that, though?</b>

03:17.540 --> 03:19.790
<b>I forgot my room key this morning.</b>

03:19.880 --> 03:20.960
<b>I can't get in.</b>

03:21.080 --> 03:24.960
<b>Even as smart as you are, you have
no clue how to actually live life.</b>

03:26.500 --> 03:29.960
<b>Well, whatever. Want to wait at my place
until your parents get home?</b>

03:30.040 --> 03:32.500
<b>That's okay. She'll be back soon.</b>

03:32.580 --> 03:35.460
<b>What are you doing, Onii-chan?</b>

03:36.630 --> 03:37.920
<b>Hey, Iroha.</b>

03:38.790 --> 03:40.830
<b>I'm glad you're back earlier than expected.</b>

03:40.920 --> 03:42.540
<b>I forgot my key, so...</b>

03:42.630 --> 03:43.710
<b>Oh...</b>

03:44.040 --> 03:45.290
<b>Who's this?</b>

03:45.380 --> 03:49.290
<b>My classmate, Aki.
Our neighbor, and my friend.</b>

03:49.380 --> 03:51.670
<b>Hm... Your friend, huh?</b>

03:51.750 --> 03:53.580
<b>Wait, you have a friend?!</b>

03:53.960 --> 03:58.170
<b>I'm Kohinata... Ozuma-kun's friend.</b>

03:58.250 --> 04:00.630
<b>My name's Ohboshi Akiteru. Nice to meet you.</b>

04:00.710 --> 04:03.330
<b>Oh... Um...</b>

04:03.420 --> 04:06.710
<b>I'm his younger sister, Kohinata Iroha.</b>

04:06.790 --> 04:09.460
<b>Thanks for... looking after my brother.</b>

04:09.920 --> 04:13.130
<b><i>Even though Ozu and I had been</i>
<i>friends for a while by then,</i></b>

04:13.210 --> 04:16.250
<b><i>that was my first time</i>
<i>seeing his sister in person.</i></b>

04:16.750 --> 04:20.540
<b><i>In other words, that's how I met the</i>
<i>Iroha who would later drive me up the wall,</i></b>

04:20.630 --> 04:24.540
<b><i>back when there wasn't</i>
<i>a single irritating thing about her.</i></b>

04:27.500 --> 04:31.210
<b>I never realized you had a little sister.</b>

04:31.290 --> 04:33.170
<b>I guess I never talked about her.</b>

04:33.250 --> 04:37.250
<b>I mean, we live in the same building,
and I'd never even seen her before.</b>

04:38.750 --> 04:40.130
<b>It's Otoi-san.</b>

04:40.210 --> 04:42.670
<b>Unusual for her to come to school.</b>

04:42.750 --> 04:45.460
<b>For real? Wasn't she expelled?</b>

04:45.540 --> 04:48.000
<b>No, I heard it was just a suspension.</b>

04:48.580 --> 04:50.630
<b>Ohboshi and Kohinata.</b>

04:52.750 --> 04:55.750
<b>I need to see you both. Behind the gym.</b>

04:55.830 --> 04:57.460
<b>Uh... Sure.</b>

05:05.500 --> 05:08.630
<b>Sorry to drag you both out here.</b>

05:09.210 --> 05:10.290
<b>Want one?</b>

05:10.380 --> 05:12.880
<b>Isn't it against the rules
to have candy at school?</b>

05:13.330 --> 05:15.460
<b>You're hilarious.</b>

05:16.080 --> 05:21.170
<b>Who'd be such a stickler for the rules with
someone who's been skipping school anyway?</b>

05:21.250 --> 05:24.830
<b>"Skipping"? I thought you were suspended.</b>

05:24.920 --> 05:28.250
<b>I never did anything to get suspended for.</b>

05:29.380 --> 05:30.580
<b>Could I get one of those?</b>

05:30.670 --> 05:31.670
<b>Hey! Ozu!</b>

05:31.750 --> 05:33.210
<b>Sure. Help yourself.</b>

05:33.790 --> 05:35.000
<b>You, too. Here.</b>

05:37.710 --> 05:38.960
<b>Um...</b>

05:39.080 --> 05:42.250
<b>So... why did you ask us to come out here?</b>

05:42.330 --> 05:46.790
<b>Oh, yeah. There's something
I wanna ask you guys.</b>

05:48.920 --> 05:53.670
<b>Is that younger student named
Kohinata Iroha your sister, Kohinata?</b>

05:54.420 --> 05:58.170
<b>Sure is, unless it's someone
with the exact same name.</b>

05:58.250 --> 06:01.460
<b>I see. So what kinda girl is she?</b>

06:01.540 --> 06:04.580
<b>What kind of girl? Well...</b>

06:04.670 --> 06:06.460
<b><i>Huh, that's unusual.</i></b>

06:06.540 --> 06:09.380
<b>- What kind of girl is Iroha...
<i>- Ozu usually answers any question right away.</i></b>

06:09.460 --> 06:10.580
<b>Um...</b>

06:10.670 --> 06:12.830
<b>Come on, dude, get it together.</b>

06:12.920 --> 06:14.580
<b>She's your sister, isn't she?</b>

06:14.670 --> 06:17.670
<b>Yeah, but you know... Hm...</b>

06:17.750 --> 06:21.420
<b>Why do you want to know about Ozu's sister?</b>

06:21.500 --> 06:24.670
<b>It's hard for him to answer if he doesn't
know the intent of your question.</b>

06:25.420 --> 06:27.420
<b>Oh, that makes sense.</b>

06:27.500 --> 06:30.670
<b>Well, see, this underclassman,
Tachibana, was asking me for advice.</b>

06:30.750 --> 06:32.460
<b>- Advice?
- Yeah.</b>

06:32.880 --> 06:37.460
<b>It seems some kid named Kohinata Iroha
has been showing interest in people like us,</b>

06:37.540 --> 06:39.540
<b>so I wondered what she was like.</b>

06:39.630 --> 06:41.630
<b>"People like us"?</b>

06:41.710 --> 06:43.330
<b>You know what I mean.</b>

06:43.420 --> 06:46.630
<b>The kinda people everyone
thinks of as delinquents.</b>

06:48.580 --> 06:50.960
<b>So she's not that type after all, then?</b>

06:51.040 --> 06:55.210
<b>Does that mean you already
knew that to some extent?</b>

06:55.290 --> 06:56.460
<b>I guess.</b>

06:56.540 --> 06:59.460
<b>I tried asking around the first-year classes,</b>

06:59.540 --> 07:03.330
<b>but all anyone told me was that she
seemed like your typical honor student.</b>

07:03.420 --> 07:04.750
<b>I get that.</b>

07:04.830 --> 07:06.540
<b>She had that air about her.</b>

07:06.630 --> 07:08.170
<b>Not that I'd really know, but...</b>

07:08.580 --> 07:10.420
<b>I thought you and her big brother</b>

07:10.500 --> 07:13.880
<b>might know the real side of her
that she doesn't show at school.</b>

07:14.250 --> 07:15.540
<b>Hm...</b>

07:15.630 --> 07:18.710
<b>So, do you want to welcome
Ozuma's sister into the fold?</b>

07:18.790 --> 07:20.920
<b>Still thinking about that.</b>

07:21.000 --> 07:25.750
<b>I mean, if she begs, I don't think
there's any reason to turn her down.</b>

07:25.830 --> 07:27.250
<b>Does that worry you?</b>

07:27.880 --> 07:29.380
<b>In various ways, yes.</b>

07:29.460 --> 07:31.830
<b>I have my own thoughts about it, too.</b>

07:31.920 --> 07:33.040
<b>Huh.</b>

07:33.130 --> 07:35.460
<b>Well, not that it matters.</b>

07:35.540 --> 07:39.460
<b><i>This Otoi girl isn't like how I'd pictured her.</i></b>

07:39.540 --> 07:42.960
<b><i>She seems more like someone who</i>
<i>looks out for others than a delinquent.</i></b>

07:43.330 --> 07:45.750
<b><i>But there's something</i>
<i>I'm more concerned about.</i></b>

07:46.380 --> 07:47.540
<b>You okay?</b>

07:47.630 --> 07:50.880
<b>Yeah. Actually... am I?</b>

07:50.960 --> 07:56.170
<b>That question she asked
should've been easy to answer.</b>

07:56.250 --> 07:57.580
<b>Really?</b>

07:57.670 --> 07:59.290
<b>Sorry. I'm kinda dense.</b>

07:59.380 --> 08:01.420
<b>Do you and your sister not get along?</b>

08:01.500 --> 08:04.920
<b>It's more like we just aren't... anything.</b>

08:05.000 --> 08:08.460
<b>There's nothing between me
and Iroha at all, really.</b>

08:08.540 --> 08:11.380
<b>What? But you were talking like
normal siblings yesterday.</b>

08:11.750 --> 08:13.420
<b>Because I forgot my key.</b>

08:13.500 --> 08:16.040
<b>I think that was the first time
we'd spoken in two months.</b>

08:16.130 --> 08:18.960
<b>Are you serious?!
What kind of siblings are you?!</b>

08:19.040 --> 08:20.960
<b>Is that... weird?</b>

08:21.080 --> 08:22.420
<b>Yes, it's weird!</b>

08:22.500 --> 08:24.250
<b>Haven't your parents said anything to you?</b>

08:24.330 --> 08:25.380
<b>I dunno.</b>

08:25.460 --> 08:28.130
<b>Our dad's been gone for a long time now,</b>

08:28.380 --> 08:31.210
<b>and our mom's so busy,
she's hardly ever home.</b>

08:31.500 --> 08:33.960
<b>She doesn't really intervene that much.</b>

08:34.040 --> 08:35.250
<b>Oh.</b>

08:36.750 --> 08:38.750
<b><i>Even though all I'm getting are fragments,</i></b>

08:38.830 --> 08:42.750
<b><i>I'm starting to see that the Kohinata</i>
<i>family's situation isn't exactly normal.</i></b>

08:42.830 --> 08:45.380
<b><i>I don't think I can just</i>
<i>leave things like this.</i></b>

08:45.750 --> 08:46.790
<b>Hey, Ozu.</b>

08:47.540 --> 08:51.540
<b>Can I come hang out at your
place after school today?</b>

08:51.630 --> 08:53.210
<b>We can do some gaming.</b>

08:56.750 --> 08:58.080
<b>Thanks for having me!</b>

08:58.790 --> 09:01.880
<b>The layout's almost exactly like my place.</b>

09:03.630 --> 09:04.710
<b><i>Huh?</i></b>

09:05.250 --> 09:08.210
<b>Um, this is the living room... isn't it?</b>

09:08.290 --> 09:10.750
<b>Yeah. Something weird about it?</b>

09:11.210 --> 09:12.790
<b>Don't you have a TV?</b>

09:12.880 --> 09:14.880
<b>This really is where you live, right?</b>

09:14.960 --> 09:18.080
<b>Yeah. I just don't use the living room.</b>

09:18.170 --> 09:19.710
<b>You don't use it?</b>

09:19.790 --> 09:21.540
<b>So you just stay in your room all the time?</b>

09:21.630 --> 09:22.670
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:28.170 --> 09:30.250
<b>Watch your step.
If you break anything, I'll get angry.</b>

09:30.330 --> 09:32.250
<b>Maybe try cleaning up in here, then!</b>

09:32.330 --> 09:35.920
<b>It's easier for me this way.
I know where everything is.</b>

09:36.630 --> 09:38.750
<b>Besides, they say being in a cluttered room</b>

09:38.830 --> 09:41.830
<b>makes you more likely
to come up with unique ideas.</b>

09:41.920 --> 09:44.830
<b>Sounds like an excuse from someone
who can't bother to clean up.</b>

09:44.920 --> 09:47.040
<b>Let me see your console. I'll hook it up.</b>

09:47.130 --> 09:48.540
<b>Sure, here.</b>

09:49.250 --> 09:52.500
<b>Wow, you even built your own PC?</b>

09:52.580 --> 09:54.500
<b>It's not that big a deal.</b>

09:54.580 --> 09:55.960
<b>Anyone can do it.</b>

09:56.630 --> 09:59.330
<b>Okay, all set. What do you wanna play?</b>

09:59.420 --> 10:00.920
<b>Huh? Oh, yeah...</b>

10:07.420 --> 10:08.920
<b>You little...</b>

10:11.710 --> 10:14.380
<b>Oh, sorry. Let me step out for a bit.</b>

10:14.460 --> 10:17.960
<b>What, running away? Did I beat you up too bad?</b>

10:18.330 --> 10:21.040
<b>Yeah, right. I just gotta use the bathroom.</b>

10:23.460 --> 10:26.330
<b><i>I'm gonna find out who Kohinata Iroha is!</i></b>

10:26.420 --> 10:28.880
<b><i>That's the whole reason I came here!</i></b>

10:29.540 --> 10:30.670
<b>Hey...</b>

10:30.750 --> 10:32.630
<b><i>Is she talking to someone?</i></b>

10:32.710 --> 10:34.420
<b><i>Damn, I can't hear well enough.</i></b>

10:34.500 --> 10:38.040
<b>- I don't know much about that.
<i>- Oh, there we go!</i></b>

10:38.130 --> 10:41.500
<b>Are you sure it's okay for me to go, though?</b>

10:41.580 --> 10:43.960
<b>- People won't think I'm being presumptuous?
<i>- Yes! Yes! Perfect!</i></b>

10:44.420 --> 10:48.960
<b>I like your music, but I don't know much about—</b>

10:51.170 --> 10:52.210
<b>Huh?</b>

10:57.000 --> 10:58.210
<b>Cancel that scream!</b>

11:02.460 --> 11:05.290
<b>It's not what you think!
I'm not some criminal!</b>

11:05.380 --> 11:08.130
<b>I'm gonna let you go now.
Please don't scream!</b>

11:08.420 --> 11:10.500
<b>I'll let go as soon as you nod yes!</b>

11:12.330 --> 11:13.380
<b>Thank goodness...</b>

11:15.630 --> 11:17.080
<b>Anyway, shall we talk?</b>

11:21.380 --> 11:22.580
<b>Ow...</b>

11:22.670 --> 11:23.830
<b>You're...</b>

11:23.920 --> 11:26.290
<b>Look, I really had no choice!</b>

11:26.380 --> 11:28.330
<b>Wow, that's low.</b>

11:28.420 --> 11:33.380
<b>How do you have "no choice" but to
sneak into someone's home and eavesdrop?</b>

11:34.130 --> 11:38.210
<b>Did you fall for me at first sight
and turn into a pervert?</b>

11:38.290 --> 11:39.750
<b>Of course not!</b>

11:41.750 --> 11:44.170
<b>You're getting a call from a Tachibana Asagi.</b>

11:44.250 --> 11:47.750
<b>You made me hang up mid-conversation,
so she's calling me back out of concern.</b>

11:47.830 --> 11:49.130
<b>Also, give me my phone!</b>

11:49.210 --> 11:50.580
<b>Oh, sorry.</b>

11:50.670 --> 11:53.580
<b>Tachibana-san?
Sorry for hanging up without warning.</b>

11:53.670 --> 11:56.290
<b>Something came up,
so I'll call you back, okay?</b>

11:56.920 --> 11:59.920
<b>Well? What made you feel
like you "had no choice"?</b>

12:00.920 --> 12:02.960
<b>Is it true that you're trying to get in</b>

12:03.080 --> 12:05.960
<b>to a circle of delinquents
through that girl on the phone?</b>

12:06.040 --> 12:07.790
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

12:07.880 --> 12:10.750
<b>Could you not make weird false
accusations based on nothing, please?</b>

12:10.830 --> 12:13.500
<b>You don't have to lie. I already know.</b>

12:13.580 --> 12:15.630
<b>And what if I am?</b>

12:15.710 --> 12:17.830
<b>I don't see how it's any of your business.</b>

12:17.920 --> 12:21.460
<b>I can't just stand by and let my friend's
sister go down the wrong path.</b>

12:21.540 --> 12:22.830
<b>It's just common sense.</b>

12:22.920 --> 12:26.330
<b>Uh, no, my brother's friend
has no business meddling in my life.</b>

12:26.420 --> 12:28.420
<b><i>That's</i> common sense.</b>

12:28.500 --> 12:31.080
<b>Isn't a friend's sister just a stranger, anyway?</b>

12:31.170 --> 12:32.670
<b><i>She hit me with logic?!</i></b>

12:34.210 --> 12:35.670
<b><i>Ozu is a good guy,</i></b>

12:36.040 --> 12:38.880
<b><i>but his unusual personality and behavior</i>
<i>make people misunderstand him,</i></b>

12:38.960 --> 12:41.290
<b><i>so he doesn't fit in at school.</i></b>

12:41.580 --> 12:45.920
<b><i>If his sister gets mixed up with Otoi and</i>
<i>causes her own misunderstandings...</i></b>

12:46.960 --> 12:49.580
<b>- Is there something troubling you?
- Huh?</b>

12:49.670 --> 12:53.420
<b>Oh, I get it. I should just talk to you
about my troubles, right?</b>

12:54.250 --> 12:56.670
<b>My brother's friend is pestering me,
and it's a real pain.</b>

12:56.750 --> 12:59.960
<b>I'd like to know how I can
get him out of my room.</b>

13:00.830 --> 13:03.710
<b>Oh... That's what this is, huh?</b>

13:04.500 --> 13:07.460
<b><i>The truth hurts sometimes.</i></b>

13:08.080 --> 13:11.080
<b>MY FRIEND'S LITTLE SISTER HAS IT IN FOR ME!</b>

13:13.130 --> 13:15.540
<b><i>The name "Tachibana Asagi,"</i></b>

13:15.830 --> 13:19.420
<b><i>and "Tachibana-san's music,"</i>
<i>which Ozu's sister mentioned...</i></b>

13:19.500 --> 13:22.420
<b><i>I asked around for hints</i>
<i>using those key words,</i></b>

13:22.500 --> 13:24.960
<b><i>and I learned that Tachibana</i>
<i>frequently skips school</i></b>

13:25.080 --> 13:28.080
<b><i>to put on street performances in the area.</i></b>

13:29.080 --> 13:32.750
<b><i>Once school's out, Ozu's sister</i>
<i>will come in contact with Tachibana.</i></b>

13:33.250 --> 13:36.330
<b><i>I told my teacher</i>
<i>that I had a fever</i></b>

13:36.420 --> 13:38.250
<b><i>and needed to leave school early.</i></b>

13:39.170 --> 13:41.290
<b>Okay, I've rehydrated.</b>

13:41.380 --> 13:43.170
<b>I can keep going now!</b>

14:06.790 --> 14:08.330
<b>Really? He just dies?</b>

14:09.630 --> 14:12.830
<b>Hey, that's our school's uniform.</b>

14:12.920 --> 14:14.670
<b>You playing hooky, bro?</b>

14:14.750 --> 14:19.290
<b>I don't need to hear that from a middle
schooler who's out busking on a school day,</b>

14:19.380 --> 14:20.750
<b>Tachibana Asagi.</b>

14:21.750 --> 14:24.880
<b>Wait, what's this? You know me, bro?</b>

14:24.960 --> 14:28.960
<b>Did you actually come looking for me?
Are you a stalker? Gross!</b>

14:29.330 --> 14:31.710
<b>I'm only doing this for Ozu's sister!</b>

14:32.380 --> 14:33.380
<b>His sister?</b>

14:33.460 --> 14:37.750
<b>Oh! Are you the pervert Iroha was
talking about who broke into her room?</b>

14:38.170 --> 14:39.710
<b>That got out fast!</b>

14:39.790 --> 14:41.830
<b>I'm Ohboshi Akiteru, second-year!</b>

14:41.920 --> 14:43.790
<b>I'll never remember that.</b>

14:43.880 --> 14:46.420
<b>I immediately forget the names
of people who don't matter.</b>

14:46.500 --> 14:48.080
<b>Can I just call you "Senpai"?</b>

14:48.170 --> 14:50.500
<b>Sure. Whatever you want.</b>

14:50.880 --> 14:53.540
<b>And? What did you want with me?</b>

14:53.630 --> 14:56.250
<b>Also, your face is really red. Are you okay?</b>

14:56.330 --> 15:00.380
<b>It's nothing that I need you
worrying... about...</b>

15:01.710 --> 15:03.750
<b>Senpai?! Wait, you're kidding me!</b>

15:03.830 --> 15:05.790
<b>Senpai! Senpai!</b>

15:07.080 --> 15:11.130
<b>That was the hottest day of that year.</b>

15:11.210 --> 15:14.170
<b>Tachibana-san panicked
and contacted Otoi-san,</b>

15:14.250 --> 15:16.630
<b>so it didn't result in anything serious.</b>

15:16.710 --> 15:18.330
<b>But it still sucked.</b>

15:18.420 --> 15:19.920
<b>Yeah, but knowing you,</b>

15:20.000 --> 15:25.960
<b>I bet you sneakily used Otoi-san's lap
as a pillow to make things even, right?</b>

15:26.040 --> 15:27.170
<b>How did you know?!</b>

15:27.250 --> 15:28.960
<b>You actually made her do that?</b>

15:29.540 --> 15:31.790
<b>I didn't make her! She put me there!</b>

15:31.880 --> 15:35.130
<b>Well, a lot of other stuff happened
with Otoi-san after that, too.</b>

15:35.210 --> 15:36.540
<b>But that doesn't matter!</b>

15:36.630 --> 15:39.290
<b>It's how we all got to where we are now.</b>

15:39.960 --> 15:41.380
<b>That's true.</b>

15:42.210 --> 15:44.750
<b>Tachibana, stop being a delinquent.</b>

15:44.830 --> 15:45.960
<b>What?!</b>

15:46.080 --> 15:49.710
<b>I know you have your reasons
for behaving this way,</b>

15:49.790 --> 15:53.790
<b>but could you just think about
how you can live a normal school life?</b>

15:54.250 --> 15:58.920
<b>Hang on a minute. This is Tachibana's
social group you're talking about,</b>

15:59.000 --> 16:01.080
<b>even if it's just for middle school.</b>

16:01.170 --> 16:03.460
<b>Forcing her to change would be heartless.</b>

16:03.540 --> 16:05.500
<b>I'm not trying to tear her away by force.</b>

16:05.880 --> 16:08.380
<b>I just want her to give it
some serious thought.</b>

16:08.830 --> 16:12.380
<b>Do people ever tell you that
you have no empathy whatsoever?</b>

16:12.460 --> 16:14.670
<b><i>She's hitting me right where it hurts.</i></b>

16:14.750 --> 16:17.290
<b><i>I've been told that</i>
<i>more times than I can count.</i></b>

16:17.960 --> 16:21.880
<b>Cutting school to hang out with your friends
isn't what you want to do in life, is it?</b>

16:21.960 --> 16:23.710
<b>Well, no.</b>

16:23.790 --> 16:26.880
<b>See? You just want to make music, right?</b>

16:26.960 --> 16:29.170
<b>Well, yeah.</b>

16:29.830 --> 16:31.960
<b>Is it the same for you, Kohinata's sister?</b>

16:32.500 --> 16:36.380
<b>It doesn't matter what I do.</b>

16:36.460 --> 16:37.790
<b>It does matter.</b>

16:37.880 --> 16:39.710
<b>More than anything else, in fact.</b>

16:40.000 --> 16:43.750
<b>Do you want to get into music,
or do you just want friends?</b>

16:44.830 --> 16:46.130
<b>Don't clam up on me.</b>

16:46.210 --> 16:48.710
<b>Why can't you answer a simple question?</b>

16:49.330 --> 16:51.670
<b>Senpai, you're being too harsh.</b>

16:51.750 --> 16:53.710
<b>You don't need to pick on Iroha so much.</b>

16:53.790 --> 16:55.380
<b>Don't say it like that.</b>

16:55.460 --> 16:57.330
<b>I'm only asking a question.</b>

16:57.420 --> 17:01.750
<b>That's the whole problem.
You're backing her into a corner.</b>

17:01.830 --> 17:04.790
<b>Iroha's not trying to get
into music or anything.</b>

17:04.880 --> 17:06.080
<b>Tachibana-san!</b>

17:06.500 --> 17:08.500
<b>Anyone would've figured it out by now.</b>

17:08.830 --> 17:12.670
<b>And to someone like me who makes
music for real, it's plain as day.</b>

17:12.750 --> 17:13.880
<b>Sorry.</b>

17:14.170 --> 17:15.460
<b>It's fine.</b>

17:15.540 --> 17:18.250
<b>I can tell you're serious
about being a fan of my music.</b>

17:18.580 --> 17:20.540
<b>Yes, that part's true!</b>

17:20.630 --> 17:21.880
<b>So why, then?</b>

17:22.580 --> 17:24.630
<b>Well... Because...</b>

17:25.170 --> 17:27.960
<b>I admire you, Tachibana-san.</b>

17:28.040 --> 17:31.580
<b>Wh-What?! You two are a yuri couple?!</b>

17:31.670 --> 17:35.330
<b>What kind of sleaze do you have to be
to turn admiration into that?!</b>

17:35.420 --> 17:36.460
<b>Sorry.</b>

17:36.540 --> 17:39.710
<b>She does what she wants,
when she wants, as much as she wants.</b>

17:39.790 --> 17:42.830
<b>She has complete confidence in herself.</b>

17:42.920 --> 17:47.170
<b>I envy her as a girl. That's all.</b>

17:47.250 --> 17:51.460
<b>But isn't that all possible without getting
mixed up with people like her and Otoi?</b>

17:51.960 --> 17:55.630
<b>This is getting to be a pain.
Can we just tell him?</b>

17:55.710 --> 17:56.750
<b>Okay.</b>

17:57.250 --> 18:01.500
<b>Iroha's mom won't let her have
any freedom or hobbies.</b>

18:02.130 --> 18:03.380
<b>What do you mean?</b>

18:03.670 --> 18:06.290
<b>I did notice there wasn't
a TV in their apartment,</b>

18:06.380 --> 18:11.670
<b>but you have a smartphone, as well as access
to manga, games, music, and videos, right?</b>

18:11.750 --> 18:12.960
<b>Yeah, that.</b>

18:13.080 --> 18:15.830
<b>I said the exact same thing.</b>

18:15.920 --> 18:17.210
<b>Yeah, but...</b>

18:17.290 --> 18:21.170
<b>No parent can keep their kid
completely tied down.</b>

18:21.630 --> 18:25.170
<b>But Iroha chooses to stick
to the rules on her own.</b>

18:25.250 --> 18:27.290
<b>She's such a good little girl.</b>

18:28.830 --> 18:31.130
<b>Hang on. Why do this, then?</b>

18:31.420 --> 18:35.460
<b>Doesn't what you're doing now
amount to betraying your mom's wishes?</b>

18:35.540 --> 18:37.500
<b>Yes, but...</b>

18:37.960 --> 18:41.630
<b><i>Ozu's able to immerse himself</i>
<i>in the research he wants to do,</i></b>

18:42.040 --> 18:45.880
<b><i>and Iroha admires Tachibana</i>
<i>for having that same kind of freedom,</i></b>

18:45.960 --> 18:48.710
<b><i>but she's obediently still</i>
<i>following her mom's rules?</i></b>

18:49.460 --> 18:53.080
<b><i>Oh, right. I never had</i>
<i>a rebellious phase, either.</i></b>

18:53.170 --> 18:54.960
<b><i>If I hadn't met Ozu,</i></b>

18:55.080 --> 18:58.790
<b><i>I probably would've gone abroad</i>
<i>with my parents like they wanted.</i></b>

18:58.880 --> 19:01.580
<b>Are you looking for something
that'll push you to change?</b>

19:03.960 --> 19:05.290
<b>Okay, I got it!</b>

19:05.790 --> 19:09.710
<b>I'm gonna solve both of your
problems in one fell swoop.</b>

19:09.790 --> 19:12.960
<b>I'll come up with a good idea
to transform Otoi's circle of friends</b>

19:13.040 --> 19:15.790
<b>into somewhere you can be free
to spend time having fun!</b>

19:16.170 --> 19:17.580
<b>Just watch me!</b>

19:17.670 --> 19:21.080
<b>Huh? What're you talking about?
No one asked for your help!</b>

19:21.170 --> 19:22.380
<b>That's precisely why I have to!</b>

19:22.460 --> 19:24.540
<b>This goes way beyond meddling!</b>

19:24.630 --> 19:27.330
<b>It's not like we want you doing this!</b>

19:27.420 --> 19:29.540
<b>I don't care what you guys want.</b>

19:29.630 --> 19:31.380
<b>I'm doing this for me and Ozu.</b>

19:31.750 --> 19:35.670
<b>What do you think you can do
to solve all this at once, anyway?</b>

19:35.750 --> 19:36.880
<b>I don't know yet.</b>

19:36.960 --> 19:38.210
<b>You have no plan?!</b>

19:38.290 --> 19:40.170
<b>Are you just messing with us?!</b>

19:40.250 --> 19:41.670
<b>I'm perfectly serious.</b>

19:41.750 --> 19:45.040
<b>My plan's a blank slate right now,
but I've made up my mind to fill it in.</b>

19:45.330 --> 19:47.710
<b>Not all blank slates are alike.</b>

19:47.790 --> 19:50.080
<b>I can't waste time here. Gotta go!</b>

19:50.170 --> 19:51.580
<b>We're splitting the bill?</b>

19:51.670 --> 19:54.040
<b>Making the call to split the bill
is a man's right!</b>

19:54.130 --> 19:56.790
<b>- Is that a thing?
- Nope.</b>

20:00.460 --> 20:04.000
<b><i>I did a bunch of internet searching</i>
<i>with my phone on the way home.</i></b>

20:05.460 --> 20:06.500
<b>Wait...</b>

20:07.080 --> 20:09.040
<b>Music and programming...</b>

20:09.130 --> 20:12.000
<b>A group of people who'd need both of those...</b>

20:17.130 --> 20:18.830
<b>Aki? What's up?</b>

20:19.460 --> 20:22.670
<b>Sorry to drop by unannounced! Hey, Ozu...</b>

20:23.170 --> 20:25.250
<b>Let's make a game!</b>

20:26.290 --> 20:28.830
<b><i>Ozu seemed surprised by the sudden proposal,</i></b>

20:28.920 --> 20:31.960
<b><i>but after I briefly explained</i>
<i>what led me to it,</i></b>

20:32.040 --> 20:34.500
<b><i>we started working on a game right away.</i></b>

20:34.960 --> 20:38.040
<b><i>With a genius like Ozu doing</i>
<i>the programming, it'd be a cakewalk.</i></b>

20:38.130 --> 20:41.880
<b><i>At least, that was what I thought,</i>
<i>but it actually wasn't that easy.</i></b>

20:42.210 --> 20:44.750
<b><i>I came up with the characters</i>
<i>and their back stories,</i></b>

20:45.080 --> 20:47.250
<b><i>and I even drew them myself.</i></b>

20:47.580 --> 20:51.790
<b><i>We decided to use public domain</i>
<i>music and sound effects,</i></b>

20:51.880 --> 20:54.250
<b><i>and somehow, we managed</i>
<i>to come up with a game.</i></b>

20:54.630 --> 20:56.540
<b>This is kind of a nice feeling.</b>

20:57.040 --> 20:58.040
<b>What is?</b>

20:58.130 --> 21:01.670
<b>Getting to share the joy of creation with you.</b>

21:01.750 --> 21:03.750
<b>Why are you talking like a veteran?</b>

21:04.040 --> 21:06.500
<b>This is the first game
you've made, too, isn't it?</b>

21:06.580 --> 21:07.750
<b>The first game, yes.</b>

21:07.830 --> 21:14.540
<b>But all of my inventions and
experiments were creations, too.</b>

21:14.630 --> 21:16.920
<b>Well, when you put it that way, I guess so.</b>

21:17.000 --> 21:19.960
<b>Creating something of worth in this world
with your own two hands...</b>

21:20.040 --> 21:22.380
<b>Don't you find it thrilling?</b>

21:23.040 --> 21:25.420
<b><i>He's right. I do feel excited.</i></b>

21:25.500 --> 21:26.630
<b><i>But...</i></b>

21:27.080 --> 21:28.170
<b>We're not there yet.</b>

21:28.250 --> 21:31.130
<b>Our game production isn't over.</b>

21:31.540 --> 21:34.830
<b>It'll only have true worth once people play it.</b>

21:34.920 --> 21:38.580
<b>That's true. Want to play it now, then?</b>

21:38.670 --> 21:41.580
<b>After all the playtesting we've already done?</b>

21:41.670 --> 21:43.830
<b>Who should we get to play it, then?</b>

21:45.580 --> 21:50.580
<b>Kohinata Iroha—your sister—and her friend.</b>

21:51.630 --> 21:55.500
<b>Translation: Becky Cottrill</b>

21:55.880 --> 21:58.960
<b>Subtitle Editing: Geoff Mazzolini
Subtitle Timing: Krzysztof Kunc</b>

21:59.500 --> 22:02.830
<b>Quality Control: Gabriella Ramirez
Translation Check: David Saylor</b>

23:21.170 --> 23:26.130
<b>I HOPE YOU'LL WATCH NEXT TIME, TOO</b>
